{title: Messenger of Heaven}
{lyricist: Sergio Rykov}
{composer: Sergio Rykov}

{start_of_verse}
Beyond the ocean of dreams set aflame
Your furious sword is gleaming through the mist.
An avalanche of senseless words rolls on,
Biting us with the heartburn of hate.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Let it roll on like a wave,
Washing away the fear of leaving alive.
But pain has torn it all open behind the wall,
Tearing down the gates of someone else's lies.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
The blue sky, the voice of carelessness,
The calm of the wind follows us.
After the storm the forest always shows,
The messenger of heaven, sheltered by hope.
{end_of_verse}
